{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "19810a91-0b52-8a7e-a5de-f1c6c05a92af",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T09:56:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good morning. Yes. I'm calling because, um, I saw a coyote. Yesterday afternoon. Near the playground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A coyote. Okay. Which playground are you talking about, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one on my street. Hold on, I wrote it down. [pause] Here. I wrote, quote, gray-brown animal, thin, walked along the fence by the swings, end quote. That was me writing it, I wanted to get it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good, that helps. And what's your name and where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zelia Varela. I'm at 26 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. The playground is just down from me, maybe a minute's walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-six Harrison Avenue, got it. Was anyone at the playground when you saw it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I saw. But there are children there after school, and I worry. It just stood there and looked around. Then it went into the brush. Let me find my place. [pause] Yes, it was about four o'clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Four o'clock yesterday, Wednesday. I'll put all that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So who responds to something like this? Is it the police? Somebody with a truck? I don't know who handles it, and I'd hate for a child to be out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That goes to animal control. I'll send your report over to them so they know where it was and when. If you see it again and it seems aggressive or it's near people, call the police right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh dear. Yes, I'll do that. Excuse me, I have to be quick, I have glue drying on the table. I scrapbook, and the page will go crooked if I leave it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, no problem. Can I get a number in case animal control needs to call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0163. That's the house phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-three. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Will somebody come out and look, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say exactly what they'll do, but they'll have your report today. They may check the area or call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll keep the curtains open and watch. Thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gracias, Mrs. Varela. Take care."
    }
  ],
